<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Enemy</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sevendust</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Seasons</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1INY8U3j0VdfhNm1xksZ9I</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.740" end="00:20.240">Step up to me!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.360" end="00:20.860">Step up to me!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.490" end="00:21.990">You wanna be a big time player?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.880" end="00:23.380">It's not to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.400" end="00:23.900">Look at all the snide ass</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.900" end="00:25.400">Actin' like a wise ass</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.970" end="00:26.470">I'll fuck up your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.750" end="00:27.250">And you'll never look back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.590" end="00:31.190">So when you fall to the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.190" end="00:35.630">And finally get back to reality</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.630" end="00:39.500">No one at all is around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.500" end="00:41.000">So tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.960" end="00:45.500">How does it feel to be the enemy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.500" end="00:47.000">Step up to me!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.080" end="00:47.580">Step up to me! (Sevendust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.300" end="00:50.340">Step up to me! Step up to me! (Sevendust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.340" end="00:52.000">Step up to me! Step up to me! (Sevendust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.000" end="00:53.500">You wanna be a big time player?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.110" end="00:54.610">It's not to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.300" end="00:55.800">Look at your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.210" end="00:56.710">Look at your name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.030" end="00:57.530">It's funny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.610" end="00:58.640">You're a loser with only yourself to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.640" end="01:00.140">Cut your fucking hair now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.560" end="01:01.060">Scared of all the stare downs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.710" end="01:02.210">You wanna be like me 'cause I'm real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.130" end="01:03.630">So you steal on your way to fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.630" end="01:05.130">Never gonna be, never gonna see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.060" end="01:06.560">Your name in the lights</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.120" end="01:07.620">You can always dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.070" end="01:08.570">What you could've been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.810" end="01:09.310">Clean up my shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.500" end="01:10.000">You look like a dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.960" end="01:10.460">Step to unemployment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.390" end="01:11.890">Step!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.600" end="01:16.660">So when you fall to the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.660" end="01:20.250">And finally get back to reality</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.250" end="01:24.250">No one at all is around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.250" end="01:25.750">So tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.650" end="01:29.250">How does it feel to be the enemy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.250" end="01:33.490">So when you fall to the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.490" end="01:38.040">And finally get back to reality</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.040" end="01:42.420">No one is around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.420" end="01:43.920">So tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.680" end="01:47.330">How does it feel to be the enemy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.330" end="01:48.830">You're the enemy!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.530" end="01:53.550">Step!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.550" end="01:55.270">Step!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.270" end="01:56.770">Step up to me, step up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.680" end="01:58.180">You're the enemy!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.600" end="02:01.890">Step!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.890" end="02:03.830">Step!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.830" end="02:05.920">Step up to me, step up to me!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.920" end="02:10.780">So when you fall to the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.780" end="02:14.480">And finally get back to reality</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.480" end="02:18.500">No onel is around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.500" end="02:20.000">So tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.600" end="02:23.270">How does it feel to be the enemy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.270" end="02:28.430">So when you fall to the ground (fall to the ground)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.430" end="02:32.360">And finally get back to reality</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.360" end="02:36.020">No one is around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.020" end="02:37.520">So tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.450" end="02:41.350">How does it feel to be the enemy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.350" end="02:42.850">You're the enemy!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.590" end="02:44.480">Step up to me! Step up to me! (Sevendust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.480" end="02:46.570">Step up to me! Step up to me! (Sevendust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.570" end="02:48.570">Step up to me! Step up to me! (Sevendust)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.570" end="02:50.070">You wanna be a big time player?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.970" end="02:51.470">It's not to be!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.440" end="02:54.440" /></div></body></tt>